<Base title="Privacy" description="How Sunnah Tools handles your location and private calculator or tracker information.">
<section class="content">
 <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>How we handle your information</h1>
 <h2>Calculators and optional location</h2>
 <p>Our current calculators run in your browser. You can enter your location manually or optionally allow your browser to share coordinates for Qibla and prayer calculations. The calculations do not require a Sunnah Tools account.</p>
 <h2>Data stored on your device</h2>
 <p>The Tasbih counter, fasting tracker and daily Salah checklist use your browser's local storage to remember progress on the same device. We do not sync this information to a user account. You can clear it through your browser's site-data controls.</p>
 <h2>Hosting, cookies and analytics</h2>
 <p>Our hosting provider may process normal technical logs when serving pages. This current release does not intentionally install advertising, analytics or marketing cookies. We will update this page before adding any service that changes those practices.</p>
 <h2>Accuracy and personal decisions</h2>
 <p>Prayer-time settings, regional Islamic dates and religious/financial matters can require individual guidance. Our calculators are informational utilities, not advice.</p>
 <p><a href="/">← Return to all tools</a></p>
</section></Base>